		background: #f6e7ce;
		color: #976424;
		margin: 0 -1px 0 -18px;
		padding-left: 18px;
		border-left: 2px solid #d1a65d;
	}
	.diagnostic {
		margin: 25px;
		background: #f8efd9;
		border: 1px solid #ead9af;
		padding: 20px;
